      "dimension_explanations": {
        "alignment": "This charity is a strong fit for Muslim donors as it is zakat-eligible and follows specific zakat policies [2]. It addresses urgent humanitarian causes and has a long track record of helping underserved populations through education and skills training [10][17]. The organization also offers many ways for donors to get involved through volunteering and quick donation options [18][19].",
        "impact": "HHRD uses 91.2% of its spending for programs, which is a very high rate of efficiency [1]. The group provides direct services like cataract surgeries, physical therapy sessions, and wheelchairs for people with disabilities [13][16]. While the cost per beneficiary is $1996.07, the organization shows strong evidence of success, such as high university entry rates for sponsored orphans and increased earning potential for graduates [8][9]."
      },
